<title>HONG KONG: Carr Indosuez sets warrants on blue-chip basket.</title>
<headline>Carr Indosuez sets warrants on blue-chip basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carr Indosuez Asia (Derivatives) Ltd said on Tuesday it has issued 25 million American-style call warrants on a basket of blue chip stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p>  HSBC Holdings Plc			 0.125 shares</p>
<p>  Hang Seng Bank Ltd			0.125 shares</p>
<p>  Bank of East Asia Ltd		   0.25  shares</p>
<p>  Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd		 0.25  shares</p>
</text>
